  "sections": {
    "subjective": {
      "statements": [
        {"id": "s_1", "text": "Patient reports headache for three days.", "evidence": ["1"], "confidence": 0.95}
      ],
      "insufficient_content": false,
      "reason": null
    },
    "objective": {
      "statements": [],
      "insufficient_content": true,
      "reason": "No objective findings discussed in this consultation"
    },
    "assessment": {
      "statements": [],
      "insufficient_content": true,
      "reason": "No assessment discussed in this consultation"
    },
    "plan": {
      "statements": [],
      "insufficient_content": true,
      "reason": "No plan discussed in this consultation"
    }
  }
}

Notice: the objective section has `insufficient_content: true` because no vitals or exam findings were discussed. This is correct — never fabricate content.

